WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.270
Pick up a bunch of flowers
in a British supermarket.

2
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:05.470
They may have been grown in Kenya.

3
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.750
Places are linked in ways
you can't always see.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.990
Now, Kerala, in India, has
a lower income than the UK.

5
00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.550
So is Kerala less
developed in every way?

6
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.790
Can money alone tell you
how developed a place is?

7
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:22.690
In this mission, you'll
trace the links of trade,

8
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.150
tourism and migration between places.

9
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.630
You'll measure development with
indicators like life expectancy

10
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.890
and literacy, and learn
three traps to avoid.

11
00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:37.630
Your mission: judge how developed
Kerala is, using evidence.
